      "id": "claim_208d83bc16024047999953af9f6197c5",
      "statement": "Deploys run migrate, then loaddata of seed/*.json, then create-system-orguser, then clear_role_permissions, so new permission seed rows reach staging and production through loaddata (which upserts by pk) and the Redis role-permission cache is cleared; locally the cache must be cleared by hand.",
