      "statement": "KPIService enforces multi-tenancy and business rules in the core layer: get_kpi filters by id and org, list_kpis combines Q(org=org) with accessible_filter, _validate_fields validates direction, time grain, tag and threshold ordering and raises KPIValidationError, update uses model_dump(exclude_unset=True) for partial patches, and create/update reload with select_related before response conversion.",
